# CVE-2025-47273: setuptools PackageIndex.download path traversal.
# The final image ships setuptools 84.2.1 (verified by the build-time
# assertion in the Dockerfile and by the package list in the scan), but
# Trivy 0.76.1 still reports a 70.3.0 artifact from the Python base layer.
# Even if 70.3.0 were present, PackageIndex is not used at runtime. Remove
# when the scanner is bumped past 0.76.1 and no longer emits the stale row.
CVE-2025-47273 exp:2027-01-31
